WEBVTT

46:12.375 --> 46:13.542
Why is your daughter going
to Bangalore all of a sudden?

46:14.250 --> 46:16.250
Bangalore? She hasn't told me about it.

46:16.917 --> 46:17.875
You're getting a call.

46:22.084 --> 46:22.959
Hello, dear.

46:23.042 --> 46:25.084
Dad, I'm going to Bangalore for a meeting.
